# Native-compile probe (task #124). The generated code is CHECKED IN
# (task #150): `crates/celeste-names/src/gen.rs` (frozen) and the traced
# kernel set, one crate per room (`crates/celeste-kernels-room00/src/
# traced/`, `-room10`, `-room20`) aggregated by `crates/celeste-kernels`,
# gated by `traced_kernels_are_current`, which regenerates it and
# compares. A build.rs cannot do that job - generating it needs the
# tracer from a crate that sits above it - and checking it in is also
# what makes a fresh clone build.
